# Disturbed Slumber: "must be blocked this turn if able" asks nothing where no block is possible (CR 509.1c), and "haste" lets a land
# that came under Bot1's control this turn attack. Bot1 plays a Forest on turn 1, makes it a 4/4 Dinosaur and attacks into Bot2's empty
# board for 4. "Until end of turn": on turn 3 the Forest is a plain land again (not a creature).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Disturbed Slumber
Plains x3
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Disturbed Slumber.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Forest > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 16
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Types = Land
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
